# --- Dependências (pnpm / npm / yarn) ---
**/node_modules/
**/.pnpm-store/
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# --- Artefatos de Build (Raiz e Subpastas) ---
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.nestjs/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Variáveis de Ambiente (DADOS SENSÍVEIS) ---
# O Git vai procurar por .env em qualquer pasta do projeto
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.production
**/.env.development
**/.env.test
**/.env.staging
**/.env*.local

# --- Prisma (Focado na pasta backend) ---
backend/prisma/migrations/
*.db
*.db-journal
backend/src/generated/prisma/

# --- Logs ---
logs
*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Testes ---
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# --- IDEs / Editores ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# --- Docker ---
.docker/
**/docker-compose.override.yml

# --- Sistema e Cache ---
.cache/
tmp/
*.tmp
**/old/
